      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14256901/assets/579eac771d54338704cba4ef1baca538f702f4ed8444d493c2975a94ba494a00.png)\n\nThe graph above shows a section of the function $y=\\frac{5}{2}\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x+C),$ where $C$ is a constant. Given that $-\\frac{\\pi }{2}<C<\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ what is the value of $C?$",
